{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00747","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享节愍太子庙乐章 武舞作 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享节愍太子庙乐章 武舞作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"武德谅雍雍，由来扫寇戎。\n劒光挥作电，旗影列成虹。\n雾廓三边静，波澄四海同。\n睿图今已盛，相共舞皇风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00747.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00747","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}